      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk if a professional can even help with this. it doesnt feel like a \"problem\" to solve, it just feels like i'm losing the signal. like the person i used to be is just... gone. and what's left is this hollow thing watching a movie of a life it doesn't even own anymore. it's actually kind of terrifying, but at the same time, it's starting to feel more logical than trying to fight it.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
