      "content": "idk. everything just feels so hollow. if the person i was is already gone, then who is even left here to do all this work? it feels like i'm just a ghost inhabiting a body that's supposed to be mine, but it isn't. if the \"me\" part of me is already gone, does it even matter if the rest follows? it feels more like i'm just waiting for the end of a movie that's already finished.",
